{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2017/05/04/6398338/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元の大先輩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"加藤夏希さんにお会いできました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくすごく嬉しかったです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとお会いしたくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂になって6年目にして叶いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ出身地の芸能界の先輩がいる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の支えです(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またお仕事出来るようにがんばります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう1人俳優の渡部秀さんも地元が同じなので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかお会い出来たらいいなぁ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人揃ったのをテレビを通して秋田の皆さんに観て頂くのが私の夢！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先輩達に追いつくのも私の夢！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまり話しては来ませんでしたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目標です(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"より一層頑張ろうと思いました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2017/05/04/6398338/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな物や、好きな事は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で楽しむのが一番だなって思った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな物を好きなだけ自分の楽しみ方でみていたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"交友関係が狭く深くタイプな私"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな物も狭く深くでした笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外に広がっていくのはこわいよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃなんでアイドルしてんだか笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな事を思ったよ♨︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台 あさひなぐ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"稽古難しいよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目線が、頭がいくらあっても足りたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"経験や引き出しのなさを痛感しているよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足りない足りない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悲鳴、悲鳴。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやりたいとおもうよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未来の自分の為にも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2017/05/04/6398338/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水玉模様の様に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな感情が色んな色で溢れていた16歳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2017/05/04/6398338/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はちょっとだけトゲトゲ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばりますか！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ★彡"}],"source":"archive"}